 class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1539775-guilty-pleasure-viewing?p=1539788#post1539788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll have to see what I can come up with, because there are waaaay too many to name... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But, off the top of my head, maybe:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0102703/\" target=\"_blank\">Prayer of the Roller Boys</a>: Corey Haim stars in a movie set in a dystopian future where he infiltrates a drug dealing, white supremacist, rollerblading gang to save his brother. It also stars Patricia Arquette. I'm hesitant to call this a guilty pleasure though and it's actually pretty awesome, at least to me.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0093171/\" target=\"_blank\">Hell comes to Frogtown</a>: Roddy Piper in a post apocalyptic world with mutant frogs.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0092746\" target=\"_blank\">Cherry 2000</a>: In the future of 2017 a guy hires a tracker to find a duplicate of this android wife who recently broke down. Starring Melanie Griffth</div> </div> </div> </div>I liked Prayer of the Roller Boys even if it was cheesy.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T12:26:28-07:00","id":1539796,"title":"","content":"Really horrible ones:<br /> <br /> Super Mario Bros, Street Fighter, Dragon Ball Evolution and Dungeons and Dragons (the very first one).<br /> <br /> Those movies are just terrible, but poking fun at them is so good, it actually makes it worth to have watched them.<br /> <br /> Less terrible: Mortal Kombat. It isn't incredible, but delivered basically everything it promised. Sometimes this sort of humbleness is all you need from a movie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T12:59:30-07:00","id":1539799,"title":"","content":"Others that I have enjoyed.<br /> <br /> Revenge of The Ninja by Cannon Films with Sho Kosigi as a transplant from Japan wanting a better life for his remaining family at his best friend insistence. He sets up some sort of import shop, but doesn't know that his business is a front for a drug smuggling operation thanks to his evil best mate. Put in a tense relationship with the local mafia and lots of martial arts action with a big fight in the end and the question of how his best friend could carry a full sized dummy and a hand held flame thrower.<br /> <br /> Mortal Kombat is a fun film but the acting is subpar with exception of Chris Lambert and the fight scenes were decent, but nothing out of the norm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T14:17:06-07:00","id":1539802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1539775-guilty-pleasure-viewing?p=1539799#post1539799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mortal Kombat is a fun film but the acting is subpar with exception of Chris Lambert and the fight scenes were decent, but nothing out of the norm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but similar things can be said of the game. While it is far better nowadays, MK used to be a very weak fighting engine, every character had the same size and moveset outside specials, and a story subpar even for the genre.<br /> <br /> As I said, it isn't a great movie. But it's fun in a humble way that I much appreciate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u2615","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-04T16:26:44-07:00","id":1539807,"title":"","content":"Street Fighter is funny bad movie if nothing else because of the late Raul Julia who did it because his kids were fans of the game.<br /> <br /> Another guilty pleasure is Commando with Arnold Schwarzenegger as a unstoppable one man army throwing cheesy one liners and seeing how a couple of years between films can totally change a person looks in the case of Vernon Wells who played Bennett and before that Wez in the Road Warrior and even better seeing the actors being capaulted into the air by poorly hidden spring boards.<br /> <br /> They Live by John Carpenter that had corporate minded aliens secretly ruling the Earth with subliminal messages and a perfectly cast Roddy Piper as a typical blue collar worker who learns of them thanks to special glasses that shows him the truth. I still like to watch it once a year and seeing how good of a performer he was","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-19-2024, 05:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T13:36:14-07:00","id":1540008,"title":"","content":"If you have never seen the director's cut of Commando, there is an extended scene of him and