y\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1539775-guilty-pleasure-viewing?p=1540728#post1540728\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't really have an issue of the time travel rules of Timecop and liked the idea that the same matter can't occupy the same place and to be fair time travel movies can be a headache as we can see how changing the smallest thing could have major repurcussions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I know! I'm a big time travel fan, and sometimes the concepts can be a little much.<br /> <br /> I'm fine with the same matter in the same place thing in Timecop. It's more how you're in a vehicle when you get sent back, but there is no vehicle when you arrive, and then the vehicle re-appears when you come back to your time. LOL. If I'm remembering that right...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-22T10:47:10-07:00","id":1540898,"title":"","content":"That was a strange idea about the vehicle appearing and disappearing during time jumps. You have to wonder where does it goes when you go back into the past and how does it reappear when you touch your device to return?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-22T11:01:53-07:00","id":1540903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1539775-guilty-pleasure-viewing?p=1540793#post1540793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Andy Sidaris is the hero that our current pop culture desperately needs but not the one it deserves. May he rest in peace.</div> </div> </div> </div>He knew what kind of movies he liked to make and had no illusions of what they were and the cast knew what they were brought on to do and had no delusions of there acting skills and were in on the joke and had fun with it. Something that today's society seems to have problem with if we go by questionable social media reports.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-25T12:19:25-07:00","id":1540997,"title":"","content":"I know that many people didn't like Indiana Jones and The Temple Of The Crystal Skull, But I found it an enjoyable film that was worth seeing and thinking that maybe the critics had to high of expectation of how good it would be as they had to move up the timeline to reflect Harrison Ford's greater age and also that Speilberg and Lucas wisely veered away from trying to ape there older directing style as they have different perspectives with marriage and children or grandchidren in some cases. To me it was a good film that tried to acknowledge lets not pretend that we are the same folks that did these films at the start of our careers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-25T16:09:35-07:00","id":1541008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <