42#post1546842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The sequel was very forgettable as I think that C. Thomas Howell just did it for a paycheck and didn't seem all that eager to reprise his role. Jake Busey was the bad guy in the film and showed that he doesn't have the acting talent of his Dad Gary Busey and wasn't all that scary.<br /> <br /> The remake wasn't a big success if I recall correctly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Jake Busey can be ok... but it's got to be the right role. Plus he's probably gotten better as an actor as he's gotten older.<br /> <br /> But I just totally spaced on there being a sequel to the Hitcher. LOL. I have no memory of it at all...<br /> <br /> I might check it out... but, if it's been this long as I haven't seen it then maybe I shouldn't bother. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-12T13:30:41-08:00","id":1546907,"title":"",